íNam 1947, Thor Heyerdahl da gay chan dong du luan the gioi qua viec ong va nam nguoi ban vuot gan 8000 kilomet Thai Binh Duong tren chiec be Kon-Tiki, dieu truoc do duoc xem la bat kha.
Trong quyen Hai trinh Kon-Tiki (chiec be mang ten vi "vua mat troi" truyen thuyet cua nguoi da do Nam My), Heyerdahl truoc het tim cach chung minh thuyet cua ong, rang chinh nguoi da do Nam My da vuot dai duong den sinh co lap nghiep tren cac dao nam Thai Binh Duong. Ong thuat lai qua trinh chuan bi lau dai cho chuyen di, tu tim trang bi, luong thuc, tai tro... den vao tan rung gia Ecuador tim cay balsa de dong be "kich thuoc y het be cua nguoi da do" xua ma ong da tra cuu trong thu vien; be chi dung go cay balsa, buoc bang lat tre, nua, hoan toan khong dung mot soi cap sat nao, bat chap moi can ngan cua cac chuyen gia rang chiec be se "khong chiu qua mot tuan le hay mot con bao".
Bang mot giong van hap dan, di dom ong tap trung ta chi tiet 102 ngay cung nam nguoi ban lenh denh tren bien ca (co nhieu hinh anh minh hoa). Ben canh chuyen doi dau voi bao to, ca map... day hoi hop, ong cung cap them cho nguoi doc nhieu chi tiet thu vi ve lich su dao Phuc sinh va quan dao Polynesia.
Chuyen hai hanh xuat phat ngay 28.4.1947 tu cang Callao o Peru va ngay 7.8 "cap ben" quan dao Tuamotu, phia dong dao Tahiti.
Tuy Kon-Tiki chua the khang dinh dut khoat duoc thuyet gay nhieu tranh luan cua Heyerdahl, nhung hanh dong day dung cam cua ong va nam nguoi ban de chung minh thuyet ay da khien tac pham nay thanh cong lon ngay tu khi ra mat cong chung nam 1947 va da duoc dich ra 66 thu tieng.
Bo phim tai lieu cung ten quay chuyen hai hanh da duoc giai Oscar nam 1952.
Ngoai chuyen di be Kon-Tiki nam 1947, ong con thuc hien them nhieu chuyen tham hiem khac tren vung Thai Binh Duong - dao Galapagos nam 1952, dao Phuc sinh nam 1955/56 va 1986/88 - de bo tro thuyet cua minh.
Qua chuyen vuot Dai Tay Duong tren mot chiec thuyen tet bang coi nam 1969/70, Heyerdahl thu chung minh rang nguoi co Ai Cap hoan toan co kha nang di thuyen buom coi toi chau My. Mot chuyen di tuong tu tu Tigris (Iraq) toi An Do nham chung minh nguoi Sumer co da giao thuong voi nen van minh An Do xua. Nam 1996, qua viec khai quat mot khu dan cu nguoi Phoenicia (Trung Dong co) Syria o Maroc, ong lai trien khai thuyet ve giao thuong duong bien voi chau My."ò
ïAlain ban ve hanh phuc la tap hop nhung doan luan cua Alain - mot triet gia noi tieng va quan trong cua Phap vao dau the ky thu 20, ve mot trong nhung cau hoi lon nhat cua nhan loai: hanh phuc. Ta kham pha, hoac tai kham pha, thong qua nhung bai viet sau sac cua ong, nhung thai do song khon ngoan nhung khong phai ai cung tung nghi den, hoac gia, da tung nghi den nhung khong du kien tri va dung cam de lam theo va phat huy den cung. Sach danh cho tat ca nhung ai tung it nhat mot lan tu dat cho minh cau hoi sau: "Hanh phuc la gi?""ù
öIn his international blockbusters The Da Vinci Code, Angels & Demons, and The Lost Symbol, Dan Brown masterfully fused history, art, codes, and symbols. In this riveting new thriller, Brown returns to his element and has crafted his highest-stakes novel to date.In the heart of Italy, Harvard professor of symbology Robert Langdon is drawn into a harrowing world centered on one of history's most enduring and mysterious literary masterpieces . . . Dante's Inferno.
Against this backdrop, Langdon battles a chilling adversary and grapples with an ingenious riddle that pulls him into a landscape of classic art, secret passageways, and futuristic science. Drawing from Dante's dark epic poem, Langdon races to find answers and decide whom to trust . . . before the world is irrevocably altered."§
°Luoc Su Van Vat
Luoc su van vat la cuon sach pho bien khoa hoc trinh bay mot cach ngan gon lich su nghien cuu khoa hoc tu nhien, nhung thanh tuu khoa hoc trong cac linh vuc khoa hoc tu nhien chinh: vat ly, hoa hoc, sinh hoc, dia chat, thien van... voi nhieu ten tuoi, giai thoai va su that.
Voi cuon sach nay, nguoi doc se biet duoc nhung gioi han trong tri thuc cua con nguoi ve vu tru va ca ve chinh trai dat. Day la cuon sach khoa hoc pho thong ban chay nhat nuoc Anh nam 2005 voi hon 300.000 ban in. Nha phe binh nguoi Anh, Craig Brown tham chi da nhan xet rang tac pham nay xung dang ban duoc 500.000.000.000 cuon (theo cach noi cua chinh Bryson, "bang voi so proton co trong mot dau cham cau").
William McGuire "Bill" Bryson, tac gia cuon sach Luoc su van vat - A Short History of Nearly Everything sinh nam 1951, la tac gia noi tieng hang dau trong the loai non-fiction o Bac My, voi vo so nguoi ham mo tren khap the gioi."ß
§Buoc vao tuoi 15, lua tuoi tran day mong mo, hoai bao, can benh thoai hoa tieu nao bong giang xuong dau co be Kito Aya. Co khoang 1.000 benh nhan tren toan Nhat Ban mac phai can benh nay va vi chua tim ra duoc nguyen nhan nen phuong phap chua tri van con la mot dau hoi lon. Bat dau bang trieu chung toan than run ray, theo thoi gian, can benh phat trien khien nguoi benh mat dan kha nang kiem soat chinh co the minh. Kito Aya cung vay, ban dau la toan than em run ray, di dung loang choang, mat mo, cam vat gi tay cung run lay bay; den luc em khong the di dung duoc nua, phai ngoi xe lan, khong phat am duoc nhu y muon, khong the cam dua va cuoi cung la nam liet giuong. Trong nhung thang ngay do, em da viet nhat ky.
Cuon nhat ky (duoc xuat ban nam 1986 voi ten goi Mot lit nuoc mat), ban dau chi don gian la de ghi lai nhung bieu hien, dien bien can benh ma Kito Aya dang phai mang, lam tu lieu cho qua trinh dieu tri nhung roi, no da tro thanh noi co be gui gam nhung xuc cam, nhung dau don, buon vui va cung la cuoc chien dai dang voi can benh hiem ngheo."≤
ØPhai Trai Dung Saila quyen sach best-seller tai My cua giao su Michael Sandel, dai hoc Harvard.
Sach ban ve van de dao duc duoi cai nhin triet hoc. Tac gia dua ra cac vu viec gay tranh cai ve van de dao duc de mo xe duoi nhieu goc do, theo quan diem cua cac hoc thuyet triet hoc khac nhau, moi chuong trinh bay sau ve mot hoc thuyet. Nho vay, tu tuong cua Aristotle, Jeremy Bentham, Immanuel Kant, John Stuart Mill, Robert Nozick, va John Rawl duoc trinh bay voi su ro rang va gan gui, ma theo New York Times la "hiem khi duoc giai thich de hieu den nhu vay"."≥	
∞	Su dung lich su Dong-Tay kim-co da dien ra tren tat ca cac chau luc cua trai dat nay, hai tac gia lap luan rang nhung quoc gia that bai la nhung dat nuoc bi cai tri boi mot nhom quyen the tap trung, va nhung nhom nay da to chuc xa hoi de phuc vu cho quyen loi rieng cua ho trong khi dai da so quan chung nhan dan phai tra gia. The luc chinh tri bi tap trung trong mot nhom nho, duoc su dung de tao ra tai san khong lo cho nhung nguoi nam giu quyen luc.
Trong khi do, nhung nuoc tro nen giau co la vi nguoi dan nuoc do lat do gioi quyen the, nhung nguoi kiem soat quyen luc, va tao ra mot xa hoi trong do cac quyen chinh tri duoc phan phoi rong rai, trong do chinh phu co trach nhiem giai trinh va phai dap ung truoc cong dan, va trong do dai da so quan chung co the tranh thu cac co hoi kinh te.
Tom lai, dieu cuon sach muon nham den la the che nao co nhung dieu chinh, cai cach de dung hop duoc cac loi ich kinh te-chinh tri va tao dieu kien cho nguoi dan lam an sinh song duoc tot nhat se thanh cong. Nhu sach da chi ra, ngay nhu Trung Quoc, khi ho giai quyet duoc phan nao do su dung hop nay, ho da co su tang truong than ky. Va gio day ho van tiep tuc giai quyet bai toan the che dung hop cua ho."÷

”
Da bao nhieu lan ban tu hoi ve su ton tai cua ban than tren the gioi nay? Da bao nhieu lan ban thay minh chim trong nhung y nghi tich cuc nhat. Da bao nhieu lan ban bo lo co hoi dang le thuoc ve ban?
Mot cuon sach hay khong chi la cuon sach khien ban nhin thay chinh ban than minh trong do ma con la mot cuon sach giup ban tro nen tot hon. Dau do da co nguoi noi rang, neu dieu gi khien ban vui ve nhung khong khien ban tot len, hay tu bo no.
"Minh la ca, viec cua minh la boi" se khien ban thay rang:
- Tu day doa ban than bang nhung y nghi tieu cuc chi khien ban rut ngan thoi gian cua nhung thang ngay vui ve.
- Muon yeu cuoc song nay, truoc het can biet chap nhan ban than va yeu chinh minh da.
- Cuoc song ngan ngui lam, chop mat mot cai la ban da them mot tuoi. Vay thi dung lang phi co hoi lam dieu minh muon.
- Hay song nhu mot chu ca, boi het minh, co gang het suc du cho ngay mai co ra sao di nua.
- Chi can la mot hat giong manh me, ban se tro thanh mot cay co thu.
Cuoc song hien dai von chua dung vo van nhung dieu phuc tap, dung giang mac them nhung "cai bay" cho chinh ban than bang nhung suy nghi tieu cuc. Hay tap trung vao viec minh co the lam duoc va lam tot cong viec ay.
Cuoc doi khong bao gio cho chung ta nhung thu thach ma con nguoi khong the vuot qua duoc. Trai tim con nguoi von la tao vat manh me nhat, chi can ban luon ghi nho dieu do."◊
‘Dengan Cepat Buku Ini Bertengger di Daftar Laris Beberapa Negara; Italia, Korea,Thailand, Vietnam, Israel, Cina, dan Inggris.
Memang inilah buku yang pertama kali menguak rahasia berabadabad bagaimana para tokoh bangsa Yahudi memaksimalkan fungsi otak mereka sekaligus memberitahu kita bagaimana menerapkan prinsip-prinsip mereka untuk meningkatkan ingatan dan pemahaman kita terhadap segala macam persoalan kita sehari-hari. Eran, yang juga orang Yahudi, memperkenalkan suatu kerangka berpikir yang sederhana dan mudah diikuti tentang cara para rabi ataupun tokoh Yahudi menanamkan kebijakan mereka kepada masyarakat umum. Buku ini sekaligus mematahkan mitos yang berkembang selama ini tentang Yahudi dan kepintaran mereka."·
ﬁTu hang chuc nam nay, Khi ta mo qua lau la tac pham kinh dien cua van chuong Singapore, vi mot le don gian: chua dung trong do la nhung gi chi tieu thuyet moi noi duoc. Cuoc doi cua Kwang Meng duoc Goh Poh Seng mieu ta het suc don gan, binh lang, nhung do la su gian di dang so ma ta thuong cam thay khi o gan su that.
Dat nuoc Singapore, hon bao gio het, dang dung o mot buoc ngoat quan trong, va cang ngay nguoi ta cang thay can phai nhin nhan "hien tuong Singapore" mot cach thau dao hon. Khi ta mo qua lau giup ich huu hieu cho mot cai nhin sau sac vao cuoc song o Singapore, qua lang kinh tieu thuyet."‚
ﬂCa phe cung Tony la su tap hop cac bai viet tren trang mang xa hoi cua tac gia Tony Buoi Sang (TnBS) ve nhung bai hoc, cau chuyen anh da trai nghiem trong cuoc song. Do co the la cach anh chia se voi cac ban tre ve nhung chuyen to tat nhu khoi nghiep,dao duc kinh doanh, hoc tap den nhung viec nho nhat nhu an mac, giao tiep, ve sinh co the... sao cho van minh, lich su. Hay chi don gian thuat lai nhung trai nghiem thuc te cua anh trong qua trinh song, kinh doanh o trong va ngoai nuoc.
Xuyen suot cuon sach, cac cau chuyen duoc ke voi giong dieu trao phung, hai huoc lai duoc the hien bang ngon ngu "cu dan mang" tao su gan gui de cac ban tre co the de dang tiep nhan. Mac du tac gia luon khang dinh nhung thong tin, chi tiet trong cau chuyen la hu cau va tham xung nhung dieu do khong co nghia lam cuon sach bot di su thu vi.
Chia se ve su ra doi cua cuon sach, tac gia tam niem khong muon nhung dieu anh tam dac va duc ket chi dung lai o mang xa hoi. Anh hi vong nhung cau chuyen cua minh thong qua Ca phe cung Tony co the thoi nguon cam hung toi nhung doc gia khong co dieu kien su dung internet, dong thoi khuyen khich van hoa doc o cac ban tre trong thoi dai ma van hoa nghe nhin dang dan chiem uu the. Don gian va khong cau ki, doc Ca phe cung Tony, doc gia se cam thay nhu dang kham pha cau chuyen cua chinh minh qua cach ke cua mot nguoi khac.
Doc Ca phe cung Tony, doc gia khong the cuoi lon nhu khi doc nhung mau chuyen cuoi, ho chi co the tum tim voi nhung triet li di dom ma TnBS mang den."¯
ı"Quoc gia khoi nghiep" la cau chuyen viet ve su phat trien than ky cua nen kinh te Israel tu luc lap quoc cho den khi tro thanh quoc gia co nen cong nghe hang dau the gioi. Quyen sach nay co the tra loi cho nhung thac mac lam the nao mot dat nuoc nho be lai co the ton tai giua su thu dich cua cac quoc gia lan can, doi pho voi nhung cuoc chien giu vung bo coi ma van tao ra su sang tao vuot bac trong cac linh vuc cong nghe, quan su va dan su.
Voi ngoi but sac sao, phong phu va tap trung nhung loi nhan xet thuc te tu nhung doanh nhan thanh cong hang dau, " Quoc gia khoi nghiep" da dem den nhung cai nhin moi me ve con nguoi va dat nuoc Israel, lam sang to phan nao nhung thanh cong tuong chung nhu khong tuong cua dat nuoc nho be nay. Ca tinh quyet liet, dam thach thuc va sang tao khong ngung cua nhung con nguoi Do Thai luu vong, chay tron va song sot sau nhung cuoc tham sat trong Chien tranh the gioi thu II, khong cam chiu cuoc song ngheo kho, ho da cung voi nhung nguoi theo Chu nghia Phuc quoc Do Thai gay dung va bao ve dat nuoc Israel bang chinh suc luc cua minh va khien ca the gioi phai kinh ngac.
Ngay nay, Israel la mot trong nhung quoc gia co nen kinh te phat trien nhat the gioi va co linh vuc cong nghe phat trien khong he thua kem Thung lung Silicon cua Hoa Ky. " Quoc gia khoi nghiep" duoc xuat ban voi hy vong se dem den cho doc gia nhung bai hoc ve khoi nghiep cua mot quoc gia luon co nen kinh te phat trien soi dong, con nguoi thi luon huong den su cach tan va huong den mot tuong lai tuoi sang hon."ˇ

